 have hardship. Hatred has already appeared from their mouths, and what their breasts conceal is greater. We have certainly made clear to you the signs, if you will use reason.","j":4,"h":7,"s":3,"a":118,"sd":null},{"k":"3:119","t":"Here you are loving them but they are not loving you, while you believe in the Scripture - all of it. And when they meet you, they say, \"We believe.\" But when they are alone, they bite their fingertips at you in rage. Say, \"Die in your rage. Indeed, Allāh is Knowing of that within the breasts.\"","j":4,"h":7,"s":3,"a":119,"sd":null},{"k":"3:120","t":"If good touches you, it distresses them; but if harm strikes you, they rejoice at it. And if you are patient and fear Allāh, their plot will not harm you at all. Indeed, Allāh is encompassing of what they do.","j":4,"h":7,"s":3,"a":120,"sd":null},{"k":"3:121","t":"And [remember] when you, [O Muḥammad], left your family in the morning to post the believers at their stations for the battle [of Uḥud] - and Allāh is Hearing and Knowing -","j":4,"h":7,"s":3,"a":121,"sd":null}],"juz":4,"hizb":7,"surahs":[3],"sajdah":false}